OL,3,GNEWSAWarning over poor parking along
OL,4,APeak District pass
OL,5,
OL,6,FMotorists parking dangerously on the
OL,7,Fside of a major road in the Peak
OL,8,FDistrict risk causing a head-on crash,
OL,9,Fpolice have said.
OL,11,FDerbyshire Police said it has been
OL,12,Fworking with partners over the summer
OL,13,Fto tackle issues with "poor parking",
OL,14,Fincluding on white lines along the A628
OL,15,FWoodhead Pass, which is a key link
OL,16,Fbetween Manchester and Sheffield.
OL,18,FThis has included carrying out
OL,19,Fadditional patrols and enforcement
OL,20,Faction. During the May Bank Holiday
OL,21,Fweekend, 21 vehicles were seized and
OL,22,Ftowed away.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
